A file target carrying `{instance}` is interpolated from the slug read off the artifact path before the write, so the hook
lands on the slug's own sidecar and the report names the interpolated path.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-hooks
title: Hooks
summary: Hook-bearing fixture for transition.
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/playbook.yaml --
state: main
graph:
  only: []
  step-pipeline:
    dependencies: [only]
    state: step
    graph:
      spec: []

states:
  main:
    artifact: index.md
    initial: intaking
    statuses:
      intaking:
        transitions:
          - to: noted
            when: nothing runs here
      noted: {terminal: true}
  step:
    artifact: steps/{instance}/index.md
    initial: spec-ing
    statuses:
      spec-ing:
        transitions:
          - to: done
            when: the instance notes are reviewed
            hooks: ["set steps/{instance}/notes.md seen=recorded"]
      done: {terminal: true}
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/only/prompt.md --
---
summary: Only step.
---

Only body.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-hooks/spec/prompt.md --
---
summary: Write the spec.
---

Spec body.
-- fixtures/cwd/run/steps/alpha/notes.md --
---
title: Alpha notes
---

Notes body.
-- cmd --
booping transition run/steps/alpha/index.md spec-ing --playbook fx-hooks --state step
booping transition run/steps/alpha/index.md done --playbook fx-hooks --state step
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
created steps/alpha/index.md
not-started → spec-ing
frontmatter: status=spec-ing
spec-ing → done
frontmatter: status=done
frontmatter steps/alpha/notes.md: seen=recorded
-- stderr --
-- expected/cwd/run/steps/alpha/notes.md --
---
title: Alpha notes
seen: recorded
---

Notes body.
